    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Music 147A/247A Ethnography of Music of the Bay Area project focus: 'AHAmele, the Hawaiian Music Ensemble of the Academy of Hawaiian Arts of Oakland, CA (Spring Quarter 2014). This archive contains audio, video, and visual elements. AUDIO RECORDING of interview with director Kainani Hartnett, WITH TRANSCRIPTION (May 5, 2014). VIDEO RECORDING of 'AHAmele performance at the 65th Satsuki Bazaar & Arts Festival at the Berkeley Buddhist Temple (May 18, 2014). IMAGES of the official event flyer, photographs of 'AHAmele in performance, photographs of 'AHAmele with hula dancer, photographs of the stage, and photographs taken around the festival (May 18, 2014).",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
